        <p style="margin-top:4px; line-height:1"><span style="font-family:Consolas">Edge / Risk / Action</span><span> 三道门独立裁决 · 审计链 </span><span style="font-family:Consolas">JSONL + SHA-256</span><span> · 防注入与 </span><span style="font-family:Consolas">PASS</span><span> 语义固化</span></p>
